# No end-of-line translation, anywhere.
#
# `lib/client.js` is a GENERATED bundle that the test suite compares byte-for-byte against
# `src/client/*.mjs` ("every source module is inlined byte-for-byte"), so a checkout must
# hand back exactly the bytes that were committed. An `eol=lf` rule would silently rewrite
# every file on checkout and make that comparison, and every hash in the verification docs,
# describe something other than the repository's content. `-text` disables all conversion.
* -text

# Real binaries (kept explicit so a future contributor does not "fix" them into text).
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.tgz binary
*.zstd binary
